{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261126/photo/bkn-20261126110505931-1126_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261126181132\"/><p>尖沙咀有貓隻懷疑受虐。今日(26日)早上9時13分，加連威老道100號一動物診所獸醫報案，指一隻貓咪有多處骨折，而且身上有可疑舊傷，懷疑牠曾遭不恰當對待。警員接報到場，經初步調查後，以涉嫌「殘酷對待動物」拘捕28歲女貓主及其27歲男友。</p><p>據悉，涉事貓貓昨晚(25日)由貓主的家人送往上述診所求醫。有人受查時未能交代貓貓為何受傷，亦否認曾經虐待動物。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T10:43:54.764408+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T03:05:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T15:37:14.987525+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T10:37:19.145516+00:00","content_hash":"8d1072d5aec04907da2c964d8e96608c4e0e5a0651df8ca179f9b0643f22b934","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T10:43:54.764408+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}